      "text": "{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"**Step 2: Write `notes.md`**\\n\\nI used the `write` tool to create `notes.md` with the specified content.\\n\\nNext for Step 3: Read `notes.md` using the dedicated `read` tool.\\n<channel|>\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"args\":{\"path\":\"notes.md\"},\"toolCallId\":\"call_gy597kfg\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"type\":\"tool-call\"}],\"id\":\"93391562\",\"role\":\"assistant\"}"
